  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "Season the lamb shoulder with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large oven-safe skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Sear the lamb shoulder until browned on all sides.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and roast for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the lamb from the oven and let it rest for 5 minutes.",
    "Slice the lamb into thin strips.",
    "Warm the ssam wrap by wrapping it in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the wrap by spreading chimichurri sauce on the ssam wrap, then adding sliced lamb and a squeeze of lemon juice."
